<p id="S4.SS4.p9.2" class="ltx_p">The edge <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}\sim\pi_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}\sim\pi_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> excludes color <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> from
<math id="S4.SS4.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>. If <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi(\beta_{1})=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi(\beta_{1})=0</annotation></semantics></math>, the neighbors
<math id="S4.SS4.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1},r_{2},\pi_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1},r_{2},\pi_{3}</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{6}</annotation></semantics></math> have colors <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0,1,2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0,1,2</annotation></semantics></math>.
If <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi(\beta_{1})=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi(\beta_{1})=2</annotation></semantics></math>, the neighbors
<math id="S4.SS4.p9.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{1},r_{2},\beta_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{1},r_{2},\beta_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{5}</annotation></semantics></math> have colors <math id="S4.SS4.p9.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0,1,2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0,1,2</annotation></semantics></math>.
Both choices are impossible.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS4.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS4.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.SS4.p10.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Case 3: <math id="S4.SS4.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(2,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(2,1)</annotation></semantics></math>.</em>
Suppose first that <math id="S4.SS4.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>. We have</p>
<table id="S4.Ex54" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{n+1}\sim\pi_{2},\pi_{3}\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\varphi(\beta_{n+1})=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">⟹</mo><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{n+1}\sim\pi_{2},\pi_{3}\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\varphi(\beta_{n+1})=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.SS4.p10.2" class="ltx_p">The neighbors
<math id="S4.SS4.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{n+1},\pi_{2},\pi_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{n+1},\pi_{2},\pi_{3}</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="S4.SS4.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{n+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{n+1}</annotation></semantics></math> have colors
<math id="S4.SS4.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0,1,2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0,1,2</annotation></semantics></math>, a contradiction.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS4.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS4.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">Suppose <math id="S4.SS4.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=0</annotation></semantics></math>. Then</span></p>
<table id="S4.Ex55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex55X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
