<p id="S4.SS4.p16.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS4.p16.1.1" class="ltx_text">Thus <math id="S4.SS4.p16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{H_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{H_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math> is not <math id="S4.SS4.p16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math>-colorable.
∎</span></p>
