<p id="S4.SS5.p10.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS5.p10.5.1" class="ltx_text">The neighbors <math id="S4.SS5.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{n+3},\pi_{1},\beta_{n+2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{n+3},\pi_{1},\beta_{n+2}</annotation></semantics></math> of
