<div id="S4.SS5.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS5.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text">Suppose that <math id="S4.SS5.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi(r_{2})=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi(r_{2})=0</annotation></semantics></math>. We have</span></p>
