<p id="S5.Thmtheorem1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmtheorem1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">the graph <math id="S5.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma(\mathsf{V}\times R)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝖵</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma(\mathsf{V}\times R)</annotation></semantics></math> is not <math id="S5.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>3</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3</annotation></semantics></math>-colorable.</span></p>
